
1. Project Title

Sales & Revenue Analysis Dashboard using Power BI

2. Introduction

The Sales & Revenue Analysis Dashboard is a business intelligence project developed using Power BI to analyze sales performance, profit trends, product performance, and regional sales distribution.

The dashboard helps users understand business insights through interactive visualizations, KPI cards, charts, and slicers.

This project demonstrates data visualization, dashboard design, KPI analysis, and business reporting skills.

3. Objectives

The main objectives of this project are:

To analyze sales and revenue data
To identify top-performing products
To track profit and sales trends
To compare sales across categories and regions
To create an interactive business dashboard
To improve decision-making using visual analytics
4. Tools and Technologies Used
Tool	Purpose
Power BI	Dashboard creation and visualization
Excel Dataset	Data source
GitHub	Project hosting and portfolio
5. Dataset Information

The dataset used in this project is the Superstore Sales Dataset.

Dataset contains:
Order ID
Product Name
Sales
Profit
Category
Region
Order Date
Customer Information

The dataset was imported into Power BI and transformed using Power Query Editor.

6. Data Preprocessing

The following preprocessing steps were performed:

Imported Excel dataset into Power BI
Opened Power Query Editor
Changed date columns using Locale settings
Converted Sales and Profit columns into Decimal Number format
Removed errors and corrected data types
Applied transformations and loaded cleaned data
7. Dashboard Features

The dashboard contains multiple interactive visualizations:

KPI Cards
Total Sales
Total Orders
Total Profit
Charts
Bar Chart for Top Selling Products
Line Chart for Sales Trend Over Years
Pie Chart for Sales Distribution by Category
Interactive Filters (Slicers)
Region Filter
Category Filter
Design Elements
Business-themed background
Sales-related image
Professional dashboard title
8. Dashboard Insights

The dashboard provides the following business insights:

Identifies products with highest sales
Shows yearly sales growth trend
Compares category-wise sales distribution
Helps analyze regional performance
Tracks total revenue and profit

These insights can help businesses make better strategic decisions.

